        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I could've been up there, where it's safer - but nooooo! "Guard that stupid bridge," they said!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я міг би бути там, де безпечніше - але нііі! "Охороняй цей дурний міст", - сказали вони!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
